product categories to expand your customer base. Reach maximum profit potential through strategic product placement!<br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3880680/extras/ebd3b2f3be17bd930a536664a826f16a.avif?t=1754669859\" /></div><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3880680/extras/3f62d86f96451ed057252f741302c80f.poster.avif?t=1754669859\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3880680/extras/3f62d86f96451ed057252f741302c80f.webm?t=1754669859\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3880680/extras/3f62d86f96451ed057252f741302c80f.mp4?t=1754669859\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div><br>\u25c6 Discover the dynamics of the game with countless weather events brought by <strong>4 different seasons</strong>. Effects like snow, rain, and scorching heat can impact everything from farming to trade. Each season brings new challenges and opportunities, adding life to the game!<br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3880680/extras/3f2a03b7eefb5a352a314e13cab9598a.avif?t=1754669859\" /></div><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3880680/extras/caa2d9fd9553d57dddb07fe8f8e492c8.poster.avif?t=1754669859\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3880680/extras/caa2d9fd9553d57dddb07fe8f8e492c8.webm?t=1754669859\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3880680/extras/caa2d9fd9553d57dddb07fe8f8e492c8.mp4?t=1754669859\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div><br>\u25c6 Diversify your farming by growing <strong>47 different crops</strong>. Optimize the processes of sowing, watering, and harvesting to achieve maximum yield. Sell your produce at markets or use it in various recipes!<br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3880680/extras/2efb015a914d083eaaea8d1ad084651e.avif?t=1754669859\" /></div><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3880680/extras/ea1d2634d6169dfd106ceba71a33b7ea.poster.avif?t=1754669859\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3880680/extras/ea1d2634d6169dfd106ceba71a33b7ea.webm?t=1754669859\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3880680/extras/ea1d2634d6169dfd106ceba71a33b7ea.mp4?t=1754669859\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div><br>\u25c6 Make your game even more colorful with events that appear on specific dates. These seasonal or special-day events offer rare rewards and surprise opportunities. Stay active to never miss out and benefit from every advantage!<br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3880680/extras/a3f7c428d28f3bb3fc24442b15b03ef6.avif?t=1754669859\" /></div><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3880680/extras/0ff809ae7e1e81763c4a23dc189c0657.poster.avif?t=1754669859\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3880680/extras/0ff809ae7e1e81763c4a23dc189c0657.webm?t=1754669859\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3880680/extras/0ff809ae7e1e81763c4a23dc189c0657.mp4?t=1754669859\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div><br>\u25c6 Raise <strong>3 different types of animals</strong> to obtain various products like milk, wool, eggs, and meat. Take care of their health and happiness to increase productivity. Sell the products you collect or use them in your own production processes!<br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3880680/extras/4825d037fe5e27f231597bf2af9ccc1e.avif?t=1754669859\" /></div><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3880680/extras/b863b3f75b5567817dd06dbbddf82290.poster.avif?t=1754669859\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3880680/extras/b863b3f75b5567817dd06dbbddf82290.webm?t=1754669859\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3880680/extras/b863b3f75b5567817dd06dbbddf82290.mp4?t=1754669859\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div><br>\u25c6 Shape your in-game relationships by completing quests from the <strong>kingdom, pirates, and townsfolk</strong>. Each quest has its own story and reward. Through these missions, you can discover new areas and witness different storylines!<br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3880680/extras/354712fb02216268b6e6b86006f9eae6.avif?t=1754669859\" /></div><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3880680/extras/a3cc3cc3a37147231a68a37c8bfbc5c3.poster.avif?t=1754669859\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3880680/extras/a3cc3cc3a37147231a68a37c8bfbc5c3.webm?t=1754669859\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3880680/extras/a3cc3cc3a37147231a68a37c8bfbc5c3.mp4?t=1754669859\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div><br>\u25c6 Grab your hammer and head to the workshop! <strong>Use 10 different machines</strong> to <strong>craft 40 unique products!</strong> From cheese to fabric, jam to alcohol everything depends on your craftsmanship. You choose what to produce and shape the economy your way!<div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3880680/extras/087fd6e72226371d5fa98bfcd4138bb9.avif?t=1754669859\" /></div></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3880680?t=1754669859","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3880680/0860852625977da3acf0c8d457faa954760f3729/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1754669859","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3880680/fd49ae0374c9424369958edf9dee298e809af740/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1754669859","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3880680/fd49ae0374c9424369958edf9dee298e809af740/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1754669859","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Camera Comfort","id":67},{"description":"Custom Volume Controls","id":68},{"description":"Playable without Timed Input","id":74},{"description":"Stereo Sound","id":69},{"description":"Subtitle Options","id":65},{"description":"Surround Sound","id":70}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"detailed_description":"<h1>Roadmap</h1><p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3880680/extras/6ca274c7af5dee0be6b8e30e8fc78d59.avif?t=1754669859\" /></div></p></p><br><h1>About the Game</h1><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img cla